{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","永寂之庭"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","永寂の花園"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","移动永寂花丛至指定格子并爆发治疗波为友军治疗。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","サイレントガーデンを指定のマスに移し、回復の波を放ち、味方のHPを回復"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，在自身位置生成一片半径1格的永寂花丛，生成期间自身处于霸体状态。花丛拥有柳博米尔此时1200%攻击力的总治疗量，每秒为其中的友军至多恢复柳博米尔150% + 10% ATK的生命值，当永寂花丛的治疗量耗尽时会枯萎，每秒补充100% ATK的治疗量，直至治疗量回满后重新恢复生机。主动使用时，将永寂花丛移动至一个格子，随后以永寂花丛为中心爆发3次治疗波，每次为2格范围内的所有友军恢复柳博米尔-110% ATK的生命值，该效果在永寂花丛枯萎时也能使用。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、自身の位置に半径1マス範囲のサイレントガーデンを召喚。召喚中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる。ガーデンは召喚時のリュボミルの攻撃力×1200%分の回復量を持ち、毎秒ガーデンの範囲内にいる味方のHPをリュボミルの150% + 10% ATK分回復。サイレントガーデンは自身が持つ回復量を使い果たすと枯れ、毎秒回復量を100% ATK補充。回復量が上限になると、ガーデンは再び復活する。アクティブ効果：サイレントガーデンを指定のマスまで移動させたあと、サイレントガーデンを中心に回復の波を3回放ち、1回につき、半径2マス以内の味方のHPをリュボミルの-110% ATK分回復。この効果はサイレントガーデンが枯れている間も発動可能"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":82,"end":88,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":116,"end":122,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":78,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":117,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":201,"end":210,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":40,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":112,"end":126,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":164,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":280,"end":289,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，每次治疗波的治疗量提升至-120% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果の回復の波の1回分の回復量が-120% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，每次治疗波的治疗量提升至-130% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果の回復の波の1回分の回復量が-130% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，每次治疗波的治疗量提升至-140% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果の回復の波の1回分の回復量が-140% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，每次治疗波的治疗量提升至-150% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果の回復の波の1回分の回復量が-150% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","噬命花丛"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","吸魂の冥花"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","敌方角色每损失一定生命值会为永寂花丛补充治疗量，主动释放时可对累计输出最高敌人造成伤害和生命流失效果。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵のHPが一定量減少するたびに、サイレントガーデンが持つ合計回復量が補充される。アクティブ効果：合計与ダメージが最も高い敵にダメージとHP流失効果を与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当场上有非召唤物敌方角色累计损失40% HP生命值时，永寂花丛便会吸收这部分养分，立即补充相当于该角色15% HP的总治疗量，最高不超过柳博米尔350% ATK。主动使用时，向累计输出最高的一名敌人抛掷永寂花，使其在后续的4秒内每秒流失柳博米尔40% + 10% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","フィールド上の召喚ユニット以外の敵のHPが合計40% HP分減少した時、サイレントガーデンはそれを養分として吸収し、合計回復量を対象の15% HP分補充。補充する回復量はリュボミルの350% ATKを超えない。アクティブ効果：合計与ダメージが最も高い敵1体にサイレンシアを投擲し、4秒間、対象は毎秒リュボミルの40% + 10% ATK分のHPが流失"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":126,"end":132,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":158,"end":164,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":52,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":73,"end":81,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":123,"end":136,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":23,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":67,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":91,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":155,"end":168,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每秒流失柳博米尔45% + 10% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","対象は毎秒リュボミルの45% + 10% ATK分のHPが流失"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每秒流失柳博米尔50% + 10% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","対象は毎秒リュボミルの50% + 10% ATK分のHPが流失"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每秒流失柳博米尔55% + 10% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","対象は毎秒リュボミルの55% + 10% ATK分のHPが流失"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","移形灵根"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","移動する根"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","移动永寂花丛至指定友军位置并吸收附近1名敌人的生命值补充永寂花丛的治疗量。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","サイレントガーデンを指定の味方の位置まで移し、近くにいる敵1体のHPを吸収し、サイレントガーデンが持つ合計回復量を補充"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","将永寂花丛移动至最虚弱的友军附近，并从最近的一名非召唤物敌人身上吸收其9% + 1%当前生命值补充永寂花丛的总治疗量。该技能吸收的生命值不超过柳博米尔250% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","サイレントガーデンを最も弱っている味方の近くまで移し、最も近くにいる召喚ユニット以外の敵1体から、その現在HP×9% + 1%のHPを吸収し、サイレントガーデンが持つ合計回復量を補充。このスキルで吸収できるHPはリュボミルの250% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":58,"end":63,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":75,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":112,"end":120,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","吸收的生命值提升至10% + 1%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","吸収するHP量が10% + 1%にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","吸收的生命值提升至11% + 1%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","吸収するHP量が11% + 1%にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","吸收的生命值提升至12% + 1%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","吸収するHP量が12% + 1%にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身治愈，当永寂花丛累计产生的治疗达到一定量后额外提升治愈。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の治療UP。サイレントガーデンによる回復量が一定値に達した後、追加で治療UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的治愈提升9点，当永寂花丛累计产生柳博米尔2400% ATK的治疗量后额外提升2点治愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治療+9。サイレントガーデンによる回復量がリュボミルの2400% ATKに達した後、追加で治療+2"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":34,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的治愈提升11点，当永寂花丛累计产生柳博米尔2400% ATK的治疗量后额外提升3点治愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治療+11。サイレントガーデンによる回復量がリュボミルの2400% ATKに達した後、追加で治療+3"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的治愈提升14点，当永寂花丛累计产生柳博米尔2400% ATK的治疗量后额外提升4点治愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治療+14。サイレントガーデンによる回復量がリュボミルの2400% ATKに達した後、追加で治療+4"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","凋亡果实"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","凋落の果実"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","每当永寂花丛通过“噬命花丛”吸取一定次数养分后会结出果实，果实爆炸后会对范围内敌人造成伤害，对友军则造成治疗效果。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","サイレントガーデンが「吸魂の冥花」により、養分を一定回数分吸収した後、果実が成り、爆発し、範囲内の敵にダメージを与え、範囲内の味方のHPを回復"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当永寂花丛通过“噬命花丛”累计吸取2次养分后，便会在花丛中央结出一颗凋亡果实，短暂延迟后果实会爆炸，对花丛范围内的所有敌人造成100% ATK伤害，并为范围内的所有友军恢复130% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","サイレントガーデンが「吸魂の冥花」により、養分を合計2回吸収するたびに、ガーデンの中央に凋落の果実が1つ成る。短時間後、凋落の果実が爆発し、ガーデンの範囲内の敵全体に100% ATKのダメージを与え、範囲内の味方全体のHPを130% ATK分回復"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":64,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":87,"end":95,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":83,"end":91,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":112,"end":120,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至110% ATK，治疗效果提升至140% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが110% ATKにUPし、HP回復量が140% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":24,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":24,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","首次累计吸取4次养分后，永寂花丛获得永久强化，每秒额外补充自身50% ATK的治疗量，且在永寂花丛未枯萎时也会生效。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","初めて養分を4回吸収した後、サイレントガーデンは永続的に強化され、毎秒、追加で合計回復量を50% ATK補充。この補充は、サイレントガーデンが枯れていない間にも行われる"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":45,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至120% ATK，治疗效果提升至150% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが120% ATKにUPし、HP回復量が150% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":24,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":24,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","进入永寂花丛中的敌人将会受到伤害和眩晕效果。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","サイレントガーデンに入った敵はダメージを受け、スタンになる"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当一名敌人进入永寂花丛中，将会立即受到120% ATK的伤害和3秒眩晕，该效果对每个敌人至多每12秒触发一次。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵がサイレントガーデンに入った時、120% ATKのダメージを受け、3秒間、スタンになる。この効果は1体の敵につき、12秒ごとに1回まで発動可能"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","永寂花"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","サイレンシア"]]}